":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jiao"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024","text":"　　皎得書，上疏陳謝，遂與寧結厚。後呂蒙當襲南郡，權欲令皎與蒙為左右部大督。蒙說權曰：「若至尊以征虜能，宜用之。以蒙能，宜用蒙。昔周瑜、程普為左右部督，共攻匯陵，雖事決於瑜，普自恃久將，且俱是督，遂共不睦，幾敗國事，此目前之戒也。」權寤，謝蒙曰：「以卿為大督，命皎為後繼。」禽關羽，定荊州，皖有力焉。建安二十四年卒。權追錄其功，封子胤為丹楊侯。胤卒，無子。弟晞嗣。領兵，有罪自殺，國除。弟咨、彌、儀，皆將軍，封侯。咨羽林督，儀無難督。咨為滕胤所殺，儀為孫峻所害。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"皎","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"寧","kind":"person","person_id":"vew_yxo_3j1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"呂蒙","kind":"person","person_id":"ibt_i7u_ykp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"皎","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"蒙","kind":"person","person_id":"ibt_i7u_ykp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"蒙","kind":"person","person_id":"ibt_i7u_ykp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"蒙","kind":"person","p